      "document": "docs/design-basis/README.md",
      "scope": "Self-contained eight-page academic report renamed to Nh\u00f3m-8_MaintAI_Kien-truc.pdf, with all four member names and student IDs on the first page. First-page spacing accommodates the roster; architectural content and the other seven pages are preserved. Two A4 landscape pages retain vector architecture/deployment diagrams. Initial100 machines x1 reading/s and scale-ready design unchanged; no runtime, wire, SQL, default or retention change.",
